known-red: "js — summon[Order[Int]]/summon[Order[String]] (for MinAgg/MaxAgg) compile to a bare identifier matching the given's runtime-registry KEY text, which is never bound anywhere in the emitted module (v1/runtime/backend/js/BUGS.md js-codegen-drops-generic-typeclass-resolution-when-multiple-instances-exist). EXPIRES when that codegen bug is fixed."
